{"page":339,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:56","surah":22,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلْكُ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلَّهِ يَحْكُمُ بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ فَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ فِى جَنَّـٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On that Day control will belong to God: He will judge between them. Those who believe and do good deeds will be admitted to Gardens of Delight,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْمُلْكُ","en_gloss":"The Sovereignty","transliteration":"al-mul'ku","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en_gloss":"(on) that Day","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِّلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(will be) for Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَحْكُمُ","en_gloss":"He will judge","transliteration":"yaḥkumu","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"So those who","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and did","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(will be) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتِ","en_gloss":"Gardens","transliteration":"jannāti","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en_gloss":"(of) Delight","transliteration":"l-naʿīmi","verse_key":"22:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:56"}]},{"verse_key":"22:57","surah":22,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"while those who disbelieve and reject Our revelations will receive a humiliating torment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and denied","transliteration":"wakadhabū","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّهِينٌۭ","en_gloss":"humiliating","transliteration":"muhīnun","verse_key":"22:57"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:57"}]},{"verse_key":"22:58","surah":22,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هَاجَرُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ثُمَّ قُتِلُوٓا۟ أَوْ مَاتُوا۟ لَيَرْزُقَنَّهُمُ ٱللَّهُ رِزْقًا حَسَنًا ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَهُوَ خَيْرُ ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He will give a generous provision to those who migrated in God’s way and were killed or died. He is the Best Provider.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَاجَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"emigrated","transliteration":"hājarū","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُتِلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"were killed","transliteration":"qutilū","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"died","transliteration":"mātū","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَيَرْزُقَنَّهُمُ","en_gloss":"surely, Allah will provide them","transliteration":"layarzuqannahumu","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"surely, Allah will provide them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رِزْقًا","en_gloss":"a provision","transliteration":"riz'qan","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حَسَنًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanan","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَهُوَ","en_gloss":"surely, He","transliteration":"lahuwa","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":17,"ar":"خَيْرُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Best","transliteration":"khayru","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the Providers","transliteration":"l-rāziqīna","verse_key":"22:58"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:58"}]},{"verse_key":"22:59","surah":22,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"لَيُدْخِلَنَّهُم مُّدْخَلًا يَرْضَوْنَهُۥ ۗ وَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَعَلِيمٌ حَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He will admit them to a place that will please them: God is all knowing and most forbearing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَيُدْخِلَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"Surely, He will admit them","transliteration":"layud'khilannahum","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُّدْخَلًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) an entrance","transliteration":"mud'khalan","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَرْضَوْنَهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"they will be pleased (with) it","transliteration":"yarḍawnahu","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَعَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"surely, (is) All-Knowing","transliteration":"laʿalīmun","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Forbearing","transliteration":"ḥalīmun","verse_key":"22:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:59"}]},{"verse_key":"22:60","surah":22,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"۞ ذَٰلِكَ وَمَنْ عَاقَبَ بِمِثْلِ مَا عُوقِبَ بِهِۦ ثُمَّ بُغِىَ عَلَيْهِ لَيَنصُرَنَّهُ ٱللَّهُ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَعَفُوٌّ غَفُورٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So it will be. God will help those who retaliate against an aggressive act merely with its like and are then wronged again: God is pardoning and most forgiving.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَاقَبَ","en_gloss":"has retaliated","transliteration":"ʿāqaba","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِمِثْلِ","en_gloss":"with the like","transliteration":"bimith'li","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) that","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عُوقِبَ","en_gloss":"he was made to suffer","transliteration":"ʿūqiba","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"by it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بُغِىَ","en_gloss":"he was oppressed","transliteration":"bughiya","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"[on him]","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَيَنصُرَنَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah will surely help him","transliteration":"layanṣurannahu","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","en_gloss":"Allah will surely help him","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَعَفُوٌّ","en_gloss":"(is) surely Oft-Pardoning","transliteration":"laʿafuwwun","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":16,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"22:60"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦٠","en_gloss":"(60)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:60"}]},{"verse_key":"22:61","surah":22,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُولِجُ ٱلَّيْلَ فِى ٱلنَّهَارِ وَيُولِجُ ٱلنَّهَارَ فِى ٱلَّيْلِ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَمِيعٌۢ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So it will be, because God makes night pass into day, and day into night, and He is all hearing and all seeing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّ","en_gloss":"(is) because","transliteration":"bi-anna","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُولِجُ","en_gloss":"causes to enter","transliteration":"yūliju","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in (to)","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāri","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيُولِجُ","en_gloss":"and causes to enter","transliteration":"wayūliju","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāra","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in (to)","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سَمِيعٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearer","transliteration":"samīʿun","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بَصِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"22:61"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦١","en_gloss":"(61)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:61"}]},{"verse_key":"22:62","surah":22,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلْحَقُّ وَأَنَّ مَا يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِهِۦ هُوَ ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلْعَلِىُّ ٱلْكَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So it will be, because it is God alone who is the Truth, and whatever else they invoke is sheer falsehood: it is God who is the Most High, the Most Great.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That (is)","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّ","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bi-anna","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the Truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"they invoke","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":10,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ","en_gloss":"(is) the falsehood","transliteration":"l-bāṭilu","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"22:62"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِ